1. Modified | Implementation code block
   Replaced the function-body implementation with directly returning the result of `_enable_mixed_precision_graph_rewrite_base(opt, loss_scale, use_v1_behavior=False)`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Conditional statement: check `mixed_precision_global_state.non_mixed_precision_session_created` and call `tf_logging.warn(...)`;
   * Assignment statement: assign the result of `_wrap_optimizer(opt, loss_scale)` to `opt`;
   * API call: call `config.set_optimizer_experimental_options({'auto_mixed_precision': True})`;
   * Assignment statement: set `mixed_precision_global_state.mixed_precision_is_enabled` to `True`;
   * Return statement: return `opt`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Return statement: return the result of `_enable_mixed_precision_graph_rewrite_base(opt, loss_scale, use_v1_behavior=False)`.
